<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GFSA SAYS JCI LOOKS ELSEWHERE FOR COAL SALE.</title>
<headline>GFSA SAYS JCI LOOKS ELSEWHERE FOR COAL SALE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd said on Thursday that it had been told by JCI that its offer for JCI's coal unit Tavistock would not currently be pursued and so it was withdrawing a cautionary statement on its shares.</p>
<p>&quot;Gold Fields Coal have been informed by JCI that it intends pursuing another offer and does not intend taking the offer further at the present time,&quot; Gold Fields said.</p>
<p>Golds Fields said it was therefore withdrawing cautionary statements on its shares and those of Gold Fields Coal Ltd.</p>
